{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"plague_bearer","model_identifier":"plague_bearer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# plague_bearer\n\nPlague bearer (C1), walker, 1.8 m = 64 u (hat crown to 69 u).\n\nA gaunt corpse in a long, stained grey-black robe with a hooded cape, rotting bandages on its arms, neck and shins, a beaked leather plague-doctor mask with pale green glowing glass eyes, a wide-brimmed hat, and a smoking iron censer swinging on a 3-link chain (bones chain_1 > chain_2 > chain_3 > censer) from the right hand. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.5, y 0.0..69.0, z -12.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 66 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `attack_censer` | 1.4 | once | key 0.6 s: the censer whips round in a flat arc in front (hits an arc, about 140 degrees, reach about 28 u from the shoulder) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | raises the censer high and shakes it |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 39.8 u per cycle (slow, the censer swings with each stride)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 59.7 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_censer`: key 0.6 s: the censer whips round in a flat arc in front (hits an arc, about 140 degrees, reach about 28 u from the shoulder)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 69, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 45, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 49, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 55, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 42.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29.25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11, 36.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29.25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 33, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 33, 2.5)\n- `fx_smoke` on `censer` at (8, 15.25, 0)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- censer chain hangs from slot_hand_r along -Y (not -Z like a handled item): 3 links of 4.5 u then the 4 u pot; `fx_smoke` at the pot lid for the censer smoke\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit goggle cubes.\n"},"description":"# plague_bearer\n\nPlague bearer (C1), walker, 1.8 m = 64 u (hat crown to 69 u).\n\nA gaunt corpse in a long, stained grey-black robe with a hooded cape, rotting bandages on its arms, neck and shins, a beaked leather plague-doctor mask with pale green glowing glass eyes, a wide-brimmed hat, and a smoking iron censer swinging on a 3-link chain (bones chain_1 > chain_2 > chain_3 > censer) from the right hand. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.5, y 0.0..69.0, z -12.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 66 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.4 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `attack_censer` | 1.4 | once | key 0.6 s: the censer whips round in a flat arc in front (hits an arc, about 140 degrees, reach about 28 u from the shoulder) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | raises the censer high and shakes it |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 1.4 s, 39.8 u per cycle (slow, the censer swings with each stride)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 59.7 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_censer`: key 0.6 s: the censer whips round in a flat arc in front (hits an arc, about 140 degrees, reach about 28 u from the shoulder)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 69, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 45, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 49, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 55, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 42.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (8, 29.25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-11, 36.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-8, 29.25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 33, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 33, 2.5)\n- `fx_smoke` on `censer` at (8, 15.25, 0)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- censer chain hangs from slot_hand_r along -Y (not -Z like a handled item): 3 links of 4.5 u then the 4 u pot; `fx_smoke` at the pot lid for the censer smoke\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit goggle cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,30.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,35.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,30.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72,43,82.0,48.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,50,6.0,55.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[82,43,92.0,48.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[6,50,12.0,55.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[46,43,56.0,49.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[56,43,66.0,49.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"cdf9fc0a-0398-5821-bd29-2abfb22efd27"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order